<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intertape Polymer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intertape Polymer cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded Intertape Polymer Group Inc to accumulate from buy, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 7/8 to 22-1/8 on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
